          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.tree import DecisionTreeRegressor\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2026)\nn_tr, n_te, d = 260, 300, 6\nX_tr = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_tr, d))\nX_te = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_te, d))\n\ndef true_signal(X):\n    return (\n        1.8 * np.sin(X[:, 0])\n        + 1.1 * X[:, 1] * X[:, 2]\n        - 0.9 * np.maximum(0.0, X[:, 3])\n        + 0.6 * np.cos(1.5 * X[:, 4])\n    )\n\n# Noise irreducible cukup tinggi (sigma=1.15) untuk menguji kekuatan regularisasi eta & subsampling\ny_tr = true_signal(X_tr) + rng.normal(0.0, 1.15, size=n_tr)\ny_te = true_signal(X_te) + rng.normal(0.0, 1.15, size=n_te)\n\ndef run_stochastic_gbm(lr: float, subsample: float, n_trees: int = 75):\n    local_rng = np.random.default_rng(42)\n    f0 = float(np.mean(y_tr))\n    F_tr = np.full(n_tr, f0, dtype=float)\n    F_te = np.full(n_te, f0, dtype=float)\n    n_sub = max(10, int(round(subsample * n_tr)))\n    best_te_rmse = np.inf\n    best_m = 0\n    oob_impr_sum = 0.0\n\n    for m in range(1, n_trees + 1):\n        if subsample < 1.0:\n            sub_idx = local_rng.choice(n_tr, size=n_sub, replace=False)\n            oob_mask = np.ones(n_tr, dtype=bool)\n            oob_mask[sub_idx] = False\n        else:\n            sub_idx = np.arange(n_tr)\n            oob_mask = None\n\n        res_sub = y_tr[sub_idx] - F_tr[sub_idx]\n        tree = DecisionTreeRegressor(max_depth=3, min_samples_leaf=8, random_state=1000 + m)\n        tree.fit(X_tr[sub_idx], res_sub)\n\n        step_tr = lr * tree.predict(X_tr)\n        step_te = lr * tree.predict(X_te)\n\n        if oob_mask is not None and np.any(oob_mask):\n            loss_before = float(np.mean((y_tr[oob_mask] - F_tr[oob_mask]) ** 2))\n            loss_after = float(np.mean((y_tr[oob_mask] - (F_tr[oob_mask] + step_tr[oob_mask])) ** 2))\n            oob_impr_sum += (loss_before - loss_after)\n\n        F_tr += step_tr\n        F_te += step_te\n        te_rmse = float(np.sqrt(np.mean((y_te - F_te) ** 2)))\n        if te_rmse < best_te_rmse:\n            best_te_rmse = te_rmse\n            best_m = m\n\n    final_tr_rmse = float(np.sqrt(np.mean((y_tr - F_tr) ** 2)))\n    final_te_rmse = float(np.sqrt(np.mean((y_te - F_te) ** 2)))\n    return final_tr_rmse, final_te_rmse, best_te_rmse, best_m, oob_impr_sum\n\nconfigs = [\n    (\"1. Agresif: lr=0.45, sub=1.00\", 0.45, 1.00),\n    (\"2. Standar: lr=0.12, sub=1.00\", 0.12, 1.00),\n    (\"3. Halus:   lr=0.05, sub=1.00\", 0.05, 1.00),\n    (\"4. Stokast: lr=0.05, sub=0.65\", 0.05, 0.65),\n]\nprint(\"=== Trade-Off Shrinkage (eta) x Stochastic Subsampling (M=75 pohon, sigma_noise=1.15) ===\")\nprint(\"Konfigurasi                   | TrRMSE@75  | TeRMSE@75  | BestTeRMSE | BestM | CumOOB_Impr\")\nprint(\"-\" * 92)\nfor label, lr, sub in configs:\n    tr75, te75, bte, bm, oob_s = run_stochastic_gbm(lr, sub)\n    oob_str = f\"{oob_s:+.4f}\" if sub < 1.0 else \"   N/A \"\n    print(f\"{label:29s} | {tr75:10.4f} | {te75:10.4f} | {bte:10.4f} | {bm:5d} | {oob_str}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Trade-Off Shrinkage (eta) x Stochastic Subsampling (M=75 pohon, sigma_noise=1.15) ===\nKonfigurasi                   | TrRMSE@75  | TeRMSE@75  | BestTeRMSE | BestM | CumOOB_Impr\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1. Agresif: lr=0.45, sub=1.00 |     0.2923 |     1.6566 |     1.6030 |    13 |    N/A \n2. Standar: lr=0.12, sub=1.00 |     0.8506 |     1.5589 |     1.5589 |    75 |    N/A \n3. Halus:   lr=0.05, sub=1.00 |     1.1982 |     1.5999 |     1.5999 |    75 |    N/A \n4. Stokast: lr=0.05, sub=0.65 |     1.1246 |     1.5093 |     1.5070 |    69 | +1.7150",
          "actualOutput": "=== Trade-Off Shrinkage (eta) x Stochastic Subsampling (M=75 pohon, sigma_noise=1.15) ===\nKonfigurasi                   | TrRMSE@75  | TeRMSE@75  | BestTeRMSE | BestM | CumOOB_Impr\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1. Agresif: lr=0.45, sub=1.00 |     0.2923 |     1.6566 |     1.6030 |    13 |    N/A \n2. Standar: lr=0.12, sub=1.00 |     0.8506 |     1.5589 |     1.5589 |    75 |    N/A \n3. Halus:   lr=0.05, sub=1.00 |     1.1982 |     1.5999 |     1.5999 |    75 |    N/A \n4. Stokast: lr=0.05, sub=0.65 |     1.1246 |     1.5093 |     1.5070 |    69 | +1.7150",
