          "solution": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef early_stopping_patience_audit(val_losses: np.ndarray, lockbox_losses: np.ndarray, patience: int, tol: float = 1e-4) -> str:\n    vl = np.asarray(val_losses, dtype=float)\n    ll = np.asarray(lockbox_losses, dtype=float)\n    best_val = vl[0]\n    best_iter = 1\n    no_improve = 0\n    stop_iter = len(vl)\n    for idx in range(1, len(vl)):\n        if vl[idx] < best_val - tol:\n            best_val = vl[idx]\n            best_iter = idx + 1\n            no_improve = 0\n        else:\n            no_improve += 1\n            if no_improve >= patience:\n                stop_iter = idx + 1\n                break\n    lock_at_best = float(ll[best_iter - 1])\n    gap = lock_at_best - float(best_val)\n    return f'best_iter={best_iter},stop_iter={stop_iter},val={best_val:.4f},lock={lock_at_best:.4f},gap={gap:+.4f}'\n```"
